      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does the 100% insurance coverage include for my household goods during a Kundalahalli relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 100% insurance offered by Shree Ashirwad covers the full declared value of every item packed, from furniture to electronics and fragile artifacts. In the unlikely event of loss, damage, or theft, the insurer reimburses the exact market price, subject to a nominal deductible. The policy also includes transit‑risk protection, handling mishaps, and weather‑related incidents, ensuring peace of mind throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are the rates for packers and movers in Kundalahalli fixed or do they vary by distance and load?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Rates are transparent yet dynamic. The base tariff is calculated per cubic foot of packed volume, with additional charges for distance, fuel surcharge, and any special handling (e.g., piano or antique). For the Kundalahalli‑to‑major‑hub corridor (≈850 km), a distance multiplier is applied, but all components are itemised in the cost matrix, so you know exactly what you’re paying without hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What certifications should I look for when selecting packers and movers in Kundalahalli?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Key certifications include IBA (Indian Banks Association) approval, which validates the mover’s financial credibility and compliance with banking reimbursement norms, and ISO 9001:2015, which guarantees systematic quality management. Shree Ashirwad also holds a valid GST registration and complies with e‑Way bill regulations, ensuring that all paperwork for corporate or government reimbursements is accepted without issue.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer protective packaging system safeguard my fragile items during long‑distance transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system layers high‑density bubble wrap (80‑GSM) over each item, followed by multi‑ply corrugated sheets, a custom‑cut foam edge protector, weather‑proof stretch film, and finally a sturdy wooden crate for extra rigidity. This combination absorbs shocks, prevents vibration, and shields against humidity. Each layer is applied by trained technicians, guaranteeing that delicate pieces such as glassware, temple idols, or electronics arrive intact even after an 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical transit times for a move from Kundalahalli to the major transport hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions and with clear checkpost clearances, the 850 km stretch is covered in 14‑16 hours of driving time, spread over one to two days depending on load size and overnight rests. Shree Ashirwad schedules dedicated multi‑axle trucks with GPS tracking, allowing real‑time monitoring and timely updates, so you can plan receipt of goods at the destination with confidence.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I store my furniture temporarily if my new home in Kundalahalli isn’t ready?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. The company offers secure, 24/7 CCTV‑monitored warehousing facilities near major highways. Items are stored on raised pallets, wrapped with the same 7‑layer system, and insured for the full declared value. Minimum storage periods start at 7 days, with flexible extensions. This service is especially useful for corporate relocations or staggered home‑moving schedules.</p>
      </div>
